{"id":276017963,"title":"249 .Node开发服务-http模块-postman工具等","summary":"Node流-可写流的start属性兼容性问题说明（了解）在ddd.text文件中写入东西。直接将原来的内容去覆盖了。这样写的话就可以在原来的内容后面进行追加了。","content":"<p>Node流-可写流的start属性兼容性问题说明（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">了解</font>）</p>\n<p>在ddd.text文件中写入东西。直接将原来的内容去覆盖了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782919334049-3e7238b7-ac2a-4d45-97a4-2df8efd6860c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782919302290-ea2b56cb-54b6-4c31-92aa-2ebecf673b89.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这样写的话就可以在原来的内容后面进行追加了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782919411246-2545cf33-272b-483f-872e-413b9020849a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782919356212-169f57e0-6b60-4ebe-9644-14ec3ad839b9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782919741557-cee09885-e928-4854-83c7-a76bcd5cea79.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>http模块--http模块开启服务器的基本过程（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782920007895-a7450d06-b178-463e-853b-c53900d93b44.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>控制台有返回，来到了那个回调，说明已经成功开启了服务器</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782920459828-2231ff47-8c57-4531-b75e-d35e32b2328d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这个回调函数就是我们要提供的服务</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782920542160-06d2770a-f9de-4c29-a139-e57789f23e92.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782920661051-e611d99c-f9ee-47cd-a52b-2d39dec0c2f4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782920698731-96d52042-d4a7-4ba4-9dc2-b03f7fc09e21.png\" alt=\"\">这样我们的请求，就有了回应。</p>\n<p>这个就是我们开启http的整个过程。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782920764265-8e0a87e2-5f40-4fe9-a8db-0787e957d797.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>http模块-创建服务器和监听的额外补充（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">了解</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782920976821-2b9f11bd-81bd-44bc-820a-91d8dd8a46f4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782921061465-643c4648-5898-4539-8cb4-7f03f85b7fb0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782921293707-a85be5d4-ba95-48d4-8538-171ac3a30485.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>http模块-postman和nodemon工具的补充（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782921868110-b3355d89-0dd5-4349-ab2d-b3c429aed34a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782922105917-753ab65a-cec5-492a-9067-512bb1239d69.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>用postman之后，我们再去访问那个原来的网址，那个语句就会只执行一次了。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782922501784-a26a44b3-f90a-49de-bc49-63948f374ab4.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782922605920-2edf9e68-301c-4e45-96af-281cf2d2525c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们要下载nodemon（全局下载），之后我们更新了代码就不用手动去关闭再打开了，他会自动帮我们去关闭再打开。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782922787321-792a36f4-cd53-46c3-842d-0eb0d4653e94.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782922859605-6f1f2d76-71b8-494e-b627-053af4a4fcb6.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782922883966-04aabd36-865e-4d4c-835f-107611d31865.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>http模块-request对象携带的信息解析（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782923058931-53531819-5cfd-4002-abbc-41bbb0d906c8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782923276954-e9ef678d-e79e-49fb-888a-dbffcb37a52b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这样的话，我们就可以创建一个快捷方式了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782923314426-108a922c-aba3-4f5f-99fd-d3c2f397dd78.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782923625784-5f97a5f3-9a5e-45ac-9fa8-2255763717cb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782923724728-68cd0a87-ead1-49b6-b143-1580704525c8.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782923781784-8ea81b11-67c1-49b6-b801-a2e1374c5d25.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782923813275-af99dd3d-cbc5-4f1a-8bf7-9221658b1f08.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>http模块-区分不同的url和method请求（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782924083023-aef8881c-3e5b-4e49-9e5b-62f655dd3954.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782924057009-bf9d0789-33ab-43f5-afbf-f27997ec1338.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们修改8000的后缀，我们send出来的东西也会不一样的。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782924350207-a65c618d-ac5b-47dd-812e-8e54830ed312.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>http模块-request传递参数-quary参数解析（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p>我们服务器怎么拿到客户端传过来的参数呢</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782924998823-c0752195-ea0a-4653-93bf-217bb3a0e65d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782925188377-4ef405e9-4cd6-40da-8de0-67eacc95e29a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782957177124-3cfc9371-197b-433c-b048-21d474057180.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>http模块-传递参数-body参数（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782957763872-02e74397-bc2f-49f6-8808-0c27928862eb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这里拿到的data是一个字符串的形式，我们需要对他做一个解析。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782957974980-0b091bb6-a105-4939-b28f-41fe1d5db0fd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782957959419-8185a725-2f59-40a8-8982-0f75ab268af7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>http模块-传递参数-headers信息（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782958234257-1a8fdd87-53bb-4386-9009-f178bd67495c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782958251714-bbf0462a-c64d-4129-8a5a-77693aaee140.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782958285788-40f69c1f-b46f-40e3-939e-3ec95e9d5a60.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782958356268-49f174f5-b412-4013-805d-e822e7c10b52.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782958589221-9f287e0f-a1b2-473a-b373-9b53264923d3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782958572382-1dcd2bfa-2954-4de4-8cab-878faf1d63ce.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782958869769-b2625223-3488-4ed9-bf51-abd92decd4a1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782959002398-be3eee67-81dc-4402-bcb6-3e966b7afe2f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>获取token<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782959043085-66a8fc19-ad2f-4a48-b4d9-3707f9681c75.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>http模块-响应结果-响应方式（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p>res本身是一个可写流。可写流可以通过write写入东西。这个可写流不让我们去调close，他的内部做了一个特殊的处理，他通过end来结束</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782959466430-52375d47-c313-41b5-bc35-ad0fcbbbc068.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782959577148-ef38f403-af0f-487e-875c-50b885da6171.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782959588917-76213a81-f8f0-4c97-b3de-1e7622372f5d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这个就是我们响应数据的两种（上图所示）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782959785520-389a044f-0e38-4ba5-852d-fe9be7b52b71.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>http模块-响应结果-响应状态码（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p>响应状态码</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782960072828-9335eea1-15b8-490b-aec6-72b52acce08b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782959943858-24045360-a11b-44ab-bf25-d9d473a224f7.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782959959159-b8278119-5439-4577-a6e1-d4a8de23a962.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>响应状态码的两个方式写法</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782960022392-225c79da-a143-484a-ab2a-1cca79e32eec.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>http模块-响应结果-响应头文件Headers（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握）</font></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782975956463-7a46896e-e7f5-4b71-ab6a-ea5aab0351e7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782960398214-be587c97-e096-47b4-b9d8-bf00741a7810.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782960368274-cc0baff8-76a8-41df-8a1e-94d2a820c0fa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>还有另外一种格式<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782960519393-0be3c73d-7db7-4377-bc1f-cd14afe822de.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782960533708-1a6eac6d-1473-492f-8411-657a8d0c3161.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>一般都是json格式</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782960565953-b4f4f6d0-5e19-43aa-98a4-76e23a978b73.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782960591441-b247664a-c8b3-4cd5-8c2c-d76084b28976.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>对于数组的方式</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782960684535-4769bd56-7427-4c8f-98de-a80f0c5dcdb1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1782960696349-5a1346df-adae-4ac5-8b1b-195318b18a3a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":80707835,"category":{"id":80707835,"name":"nodejs","description":""},"created_at":"2026-07-01T14:47:27.000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T07:05:59.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/hkk7kv/fyecocftg9c864s8","slug":"fyecocftg9c864s8","wordCount":621}